[req.181629]
title = "Archived shipping evidence preserves retention eligibility for identical reappearing snapshots"
ac_1 = "Given Retain=1 and the production ledger dependency wired at services/wallet/attestor/cmd/attestor/main.go:250 and main.go:272, when a writer-produced shipped snapshot A is deleted through Writer.Retain, archived by Ship, restored byte-for-byte beside newer shipped B and recognized without upload, then Writer.Retain at services/wallet/attestor/internal/backup/writer.go:255 deletes A and keeps B across ledger reopening, writer recreation and repeated Ship/Retain passes; changed-size, changed-digest, unshipped and invalid-archive snapshots stay protected, archive errors are reported, duplicate shipping remains unchanged, and active ledger memory and serialized size stay independent of retired history."

